# Kosen Systems Storefront

Adafruit-Style Hardware Module Store

## Overview

This repository defines the architecture and framework for building an **electronics module storefront similar in structure to Adafruit**.

The platform will allow:

* Selling embedded and IoT hardware modules
* Hosting documentation and tutorials
* Managing orders and inventory through an admin dashboard
* Providing schematics, firmware, and developer resources

The system is designed to be **scalable, developer-friendly, and modern**, using **Supabase as the backend platform** and **Razorpay for payments**.

---

# System Architecture

```text
Customer
   │
   ▼
Frontend (Next.js / React)
   │
   ▼
Backend API (Node.js / Edge Functions)
   │
   ├─ Product Service
   ├─ Order Service
   ├─ Documentation Service
   │
   ▼
Supabase Backend
 ├ PostgreSQL Database
 ├ Authentication
 ├ Storage
 │
 ▼
Payment Gateway
 └ Razorpay
```

This architecture supports:

* Product sales
* Hardware documentation
* Tutorials and guides
* Order management
* Admin control panel
* Secure authentication

---

# Project Structure

```text
kosen-systems-store/
│
├── frontend/
