# Supabase Integration

Supabase provides:

* PostgreSQL database
* authentication system
* file storage
* real-time APIs

### Supabase Usage

| Feature  | Supabase Service               |
| -------- | ------------------------------ |
| Database | PostgreSQL                     |
| Auth     | Supabase Auth                  |
| Storage  | Supabase Storage               |
| API      | Supabase REST / Edge Functions |

Example database tables:

### Products Table

```text
products
   id
   name
   price
   description
   category
   images
   datasheet
   specs
   stock
```

### Orders Table

```text
orders
   id
   user_id
   items
   total
   payment_status
   order_status
```

### Tutorials Table

```text
tutorials
   id
   title
   product_id
   content
   images
```

---

# Razorpay Payment Integration

Payments will be processed using **Razorpay**.

### Payment Flow

```text
User Checkout
   │
   ▼
Create Razorpay Order
   │
   ▼
User Pays via Razorpay
   │
   ▼
Webhook Verification
   │
   ▼
Update Order in Supabase
```

Supported payment methods:

* UPI
* Debit / Credit Card
* Net Banking
* Wallets

