# Documentation System

A documentation portal similar to Adafruit guides.

```text
docs-site/
│
├── guides/
│   ├── buck-converter-guide.md
│   ├── esp32-iot-board-guide.md
│
├── images/
│
├── examples/
│   ├── arduino
│   └── micropython
│
└── index.js
```

Example guide:

```
How to use the MP1584 Buck Converter
------------------------------------

Input Voltage: 6V–28V
Output Voltage: Adjustable

Steps:
1. Connect VIN
2. Adjust potentiometer
3. Measure output voltage
```

