# Goal

Build a **professional electronics hardware platform similar in structure to Adafruit**, focused on:

* high-quality hardware modules
* strong technical documentation
* developer-friendly resources

This architecture ensures the platform remains **scalable, maintainable, and hardware-developer focused**.
